    "turn_idx": 323,
    "turn_text": "You were right. You are 100% right, Barbara. There's and there's no doubt about it. Let's move on to and I've been saying there are a lot of these these candidates like Dan Cox in Maryland, like like Doug Mustriano in Pennsylvania. And I've heard some of these ads that they cannot win. Right? No, it's but Donald Trump is one for one 45 Donald Trump is one 45 at 11 in primary so far. So you tell me that a Trump-backed candidate isn't going to win?",
