    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96940.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 394,
    "turn_text": "Well, let's hope she doesn't get elected. But I appreciate your phone call. Hold on a second, Diane. We'll get you the email address if you'd like to send a piece of comedy, if you have it. Generally, guys, I'll just tell you, I've always been my own comedy writer. I started writing for Rush. I had been writing for others radio networks before that. And I always wrote my own material for my own show. And I do share other material, but I always give credit to other people. Jim Gossett is someone I've been writing with for years. Jim and I collaborate on stuff. And then he also just writes his own stuff. And whenever I feature it on my show, I do that because I trust Jim Gossett. He is a friend of mine. And he has great judgment as a comedy writer and a performer. So that's generally I do get a lot of solicitations from people and and I appreciate it greatly. There are exceptions where I'll run material if you send it. Don't take it personally if we don't get back to you right away because we get a lot of solicitations and sometimes I opt to kind of keep it in house. All right. But that's it. I do feature other people on the show. Sean Farish is a guy who does Trump impersonation. I've written with him and had him do a few things like my version of Trump singing a fight for the right to party. Things like that. But if you have a suggestion, you can write me at Robcy at Newsmax.com. Rob C at Newsmax.com, that's my corporate email, and if you have a parody, you can send it, not guarantee and that'll get on the air, not guarantee it'll get produced if you just send lyrics. In fact, if you just send lyrics, I will not produce your song. I don't have time to do it. I don't have time to",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_13",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "I have always been my own comedy writer.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "I always write my own material for my own show.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "I appreciate your phone call.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Jim Gossett is someone I've collaborated with for years.",
        "confidence": 0.95
